<Document>
  <name>North Thailand Moto Riding — Cinematic</name>
  <description><![CDATA[Noah and Bryan's moto trips through North Thailand. Open the tour “▶ Play Cinematic Slideshow” below for an auto fly-through of every photo.]]></description>
